        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <style>\n        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f8f9fa; margin: 0; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }\n        .container { background-color: #ffffff; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e1e4e8; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }\n        .header { border-bottom: 3px solid #007bff; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; }\n        .priority-tag { background-color: #ebf5ff; color: #007bff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n        .id-badge { float: right; color: #6a737d; font-size: 11px; font-family: monospace; }\n        .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; }\n        .info-label { font-size: 11px; color: #6c757d; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 3px; }\n        .info-value { font-size: 14px; color: #212529; font-weight: 500; }\n        .message-box { background-color: #fff9db; border-left: 6px solid #fcc419; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }\n        .duration-highlight { color: #d9480f; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; }\n        .instruction-box { background-color: #f1f3f5; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px dashed #ced4da; }\n        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #868e96; margin-top: 40px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; padding-top: 20px; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <span class=\"id-badge\">REF: #{{ $json.ticket_id }}</span>\n            <span class=\"priority-tag\">Awaiting Assignment</span>\n            <h2 style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #212529;\">New {{ $json.department }} Request</h2>\n        </div>\n        \n        <p>A new <strong>{{ $json.issue_category }}</strong> issue requires attention:</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"info-grid\">\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"info-label\">Location</div>\n                <div class=\"info-value\">{{ $json.block_room_no }}</div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"info-label\">Reported By</div>\n                <div class=\"info-value\">{{ $json.student_name }}</div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"info-label\">Contact Number</div>\n                <div class=\"info-value\">{{ $json.student_telephone }}</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"message-box\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #856404; margin-bottom: 5px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold;\">Issue Description</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #212529;\">{{ $json.description }}</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #495057;\">AI Estimated Repair Time:</p>\n            <span class=\"duration-highlight\">{{ $json.estimated_minutes }} Minutes</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"instruction-box\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #343a40;\">How to Claim this Job:</h4>\n            <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">If you are available, please <strong>reply to this email</strong> directly.</p>\n            \n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #495057; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 15px;\"><strong>Important Reply Instructions:</strong></p>\n            <ol style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #495057; margin-top: 0; padding-left: 20px;\">\n                <li>Your reply must be in <strong>English</strong>.</li>\n                <li>State your intended working time using <strong>military time</strong> (e.g., 14:00 instead of 2:00 PM).</li>\n            </ol>\n\n            <code style=\"display: block; background: #fff; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\">\n                Example: \"I'll take it. I'll be there at 14:00\"\n            </code>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            University Maintenance Dispatcher • Reply to claim ticket #{{ $json.ticket_id }}\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
